<title>UK: Abbey Natl adds 250 mln stg to 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey Natl adds 250 mln stg to 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT ** 250 MLN STG   COUPON     7.625     MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.198    PAY DATE    23.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    99.198    SPREAD	+30 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 150 MLN STG ISSUE LAUNCHED</p>
<p>		AUG 1996 (PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST)</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 S&amp;P	  AA	  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
</text>
